# Platinum Angel: "You can't lose the game" (CR 104.3, 704.5a). Bot1 begins at 3 life and casts the Angel on turn 3 off
# Sol Ring, Mox Pearl, Black Lotus and two Plains. Bot2 Bolts Bot1 to 0 on turn 4: the state-based action that would make
# Bot1 lose does not, and the game goes on with Bot1 at 0 life. On turn 6 Bot2 Disenchants the Angel; at the next check
# Bot1, still at 0 life, loses (the 2009-10-01 ruling), and Bot2, the one player left, wins (CR 104.2a).

